ning the walls","of the fortress, and a fair","number of soldiers just ","inside to back them up.","IT SEEMS CLEAR THAT THESE","SOLDIERS ARE PREPARING FOR","MUCH MORE THAN OUR ASSAULT,","AND THOUGH THEIR PLANS IN THIS","AREA CAN ONLY BE GUESSED","AT, I MUST WONDER IF THEY","INTEND TO MAKE A SNEAK ATTACK","AGAINST OUR HOMELAND IN THE","KOREN EMPIRE.  SUCH A MOVE","BY SUCH A PITIFUL FORCE","WOULD SEEM FOOLHARDY."],"map":{"width":40,"height":60,"tiles":[18,16,1,16,17,1,18,18,16,1,17,16,18,1,18,18,1,18,16,18,1,4,83,1,17,16,1,16,17,1,17,16,1,16,17,1,1,1,67,18,18,18,17,16,18,16,16,17,1,1,1,18,18,17,1,17,16,1,18,17,1,4,95,1,16,17,17,16,18,18,16,18,16,1,17,16,16,1,16,18,1,16,17,17,1,17,1,18,16,18,17,18,1,18,17,16,16,17,18,17,18,4,95,18,17,18,18,16,16,17,1,17,1,1,18,17,1,17,18,18,17,18,17,18,18,17,18,17,1,1,17,18,17,1,18,16,17,18,18,17,1,4,96,18,1,16,18,16,17,18,1,18,17,16,17,16,16,17,17,16,1,18,17,16,17,18,16,16,18,18,1,16,16,17,17,16,18,18,16,1,18,4,95,17,18,17,17,17,16,17,1,18,1,1,18,18,16,1,67,16,1,17,1,17,17,18,16,18,18,17,1,17,1,16,1,18,16,16,16,1,17,4,96,1,17,18,18,1,18,17,18,18,16,1,16,17,17,17,1,18,17,16,16,1,17,17,18,18,16,16,16,16,18,18,1,17,17,18,17,18,17,4,96,17,16,16,16,1,17,18,1,16,16,1,17,1,17,16,17,17,16,1,17,1,16,16,18,18,18,17,17,16,1,1,18,17,17,18,17,17,18,4,95,18,17,18,17,18,18,18,17,1,16,16,18,16,17,1,16,17,16,17,16,1,17,1,16,18,16,17,1,17,1,16,1,17,18,1,1,16,17,4,96,16,18,18,18,17,16,17,17,17,67,1,16,1,1,16,1,16,16,1,16,16,1,18,18,18,16,18,16,18,16,16,18,17,16,1,18,17,17,4,96,1,17,16,17,18,18,1,16,1,1,16,18,1,17,18,18,16,18,18,17,18,16,18,18,1,18,1,1,16,1,1,1,18,18,17,16,1,17,4,95,1,1,1,1,16,18,1,16,16,17,18,1,17,16,18,17,18,1,1,17,1,1,1,18,1,1,16,16,18,16,4,0,0,0,5,16,17,16,4,96,1,17,18,18,67,17,1,16,18,16,1,18,18,18,18,16,1,18,17,17,76,72,76,1,17,16,17,1,17,1,4,17,1,16,4,16,16,1,4,96,17,16,16,1,17,17,17,18,16,16,1,18,16,1,18,16,16,16,1,18,75,72,75,18,16,1,57,57,57,57,4,18,18,1,4,16,16,16,4,96,1,18,18,1,17,16,18,1,1,16,17,16,1,16,17,1,18,16,18,17,76,7